            "notes": "Round 3 is a big round. Aside from the  [Tokki Slam](item_9e2b8c2e-ed2f-4ce9-8424-9c86664e3925)  you now have the added option of being a melee demon.  [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7)  will also heal you so you can heal back some of the damage you take while going in for the Tokki Slam.\n\nIf you are up against a Zarya and have enough money you can buy  [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131)  but the other items are must buys for your damage and so you can settle for  [Refraction Armor](item_dd020802-8d00-489d-93e0-930b80e31144)",
