            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-19T13:04:45.259124+00:00",
            "notes": "Because this build is ultimately a counter build, you are expecting to play against another D.va or Zarya so for the 3rd power you can go either  [Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8)  to eat D.va missiles and other projectiles easily or  [Stat Boost](item_d3ef725b-3183-417c-bc5a-76bfa21c6cc5)  in order to get your matrix uptime high against zarya to reduce damage from her beam with  [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131) . \n\n [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4)  gives the most damage and hp but you can also go  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d)  for damage reduction if from raw damage.\n\nAgainst heroe's that have alot of \"tick damage\" like Zarya, Mei, Ashe dynamite, Reaper etc, I do suggest going for  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) since itll be easier to reach that 20% dmg reduction.\n\nRound 5 is another power spike for the enemy team. Tokki Slam starts to fall off from this hard carry tons of damage unkillable being to decent damage but can certainly get bursted. You will have trouble finishing off kills here but if you are still unkillable you can go into  [Express Detonation](item_8da4cbad-78cb-4ebd-8bc4-8dc150afec95) and  [Nano Cola\u2122 Nitrous](item_9e63ff90-c7d7-4695-a6cb-575b2619a963) here instead to get more cheeky bomb kills. Do note that bomb even basekit still does a max of 1000 damage, and since you have 15% AP from  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) then this should kill most squishies even with the extra stadium health and survival items. So theres no need to invest into AP to increase bomb lethality.",
